      "message": "docs(process): crates/ui/AGENTS.md steering document for UI work\n\nGathers the UI laws already in the root AGENTS.md and the cited issues\n(layering, commands, setup-page controls #1104, form seam #1122, 400-line\nfiles, structural tests, icon sources #661) into a steering addendum, each\nrule linked to its source. Root AGENTS.md links it from the Assets section\nand the file joins the process-file sync list. PROCESS_VERSION 31.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nFixes #1121",
